SUMMARY:Botanical Blueprints with Linda Clark Johnson
DESCRIPTION:Botanical Blueprints with Linda Clark Johnson\nSunday\, May 31\, 10 AM – 2 PM\n$115 Members | $125 Non-Members\n(All materials included except for flowers and foliage\, which participants should bring) \nYou don’t need to be an artist to enjoy making beautiful blue cyanotypes! In this introductory class with artist Linda Clark Johnson\, you’ll learn all the basics of this fun and easy alternative photographic technique. Using light-sensitive chemicals\, you’ll expose prints of plants in the sun and process them in water. By the time you leave\, you’ll have 4 gorgeous 8 x 10” blueprints and the know-how to create more at home. \nRegister here: https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/workshops-and-classes/ \nAny questions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/botanical-blueprints-with-linda-clark-johnson/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/For-workshop-Linda-Clark-Johnson.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencegallery@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
